tensorflow/lite: find_dependency for farmhash and fft2d in tensorflow-liteConfig.cmake.

tensorflow-lite links the farmhash and fft2d_fftsg2d targets PUBLIC, but the installed
tensorflow-liteConfig.cmake does not look for their packages, and linking fails with
"cannot find -lfarmhash / -lfft2d_fftsg2d". Not fixed upstream in TF 2.20.

--- a/tensorflow/lite/tools/cmake/tensorflow-liteConfig.cmake.in
+++ b/tensorflow/lite/tools/cmake/tensorflow-liteConfig.cmake.in
@@ -22,6 +22,8 @@
 find_dependency(cpuinfo)
 find_dependency(ruy)
 find_dependency(gemmlowp)
+find_dependency(farmhash)
+find_dependency(fft2d)
 
 @PACKAGE_INIT@
 
